{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T12:20:44.208680Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_fluffy_squirrel.stdmod_1", "source": "tm", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_language", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Tłumaczenie zawiera 90% nieprzetłumaczonych angielskich słów", "en_kept_ratio": 0.909}, {"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >84 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}, {"type": "partial_translation_mix", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Tłumaczenie to mix EN/lang (>70% EN): '¿Ch? Chhh?? <though you don't understand squirreli' (EN: 'Chh? Chhh?? <though you don't understand squirreli')"}], "action": "fallback_to_google_translate_high", "en": "Chh? Chhh?? <though you don't understand squirrelish, that one seems really excited>", "translated": "¿Ch? Chhh?? <though you don't understand squirrelish, that one seems really excited>"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T12:20:44.260542Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.say_10", "source": "existing_value", "severity": "CRITICAL", "issues": [{"type": "trailing_space_contract", "severity": "CRITICAL", "message": "Utrata końcowej spacji dla fragmentu łączonego runtime"}], "action": "retranslate", "en": "You return through the semi-translucent gate to the west. ", "translated": "Regresas por la puerta semitranslúcida hacia el oeste."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T12:20:44.261743Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.say_11", "source": "existing_value", "severity": "CRITICAL", "issues": [{"type": "trailing_space_contract", "severity": "CRITICAL", "message": "Utrata końcowej spacji dla fragmentu łączonego runtime"}], "action": "retranslate", "en": "You head back north to the plateau. ", "translated": "Regresas al norte hasta la meseta."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T12:20:44.263198Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.say_12", "source": "existing_value", "severity": "CRITICAL", "issues": [{"type": "trailing_space_contract", "severity": "CRITICAL", "message": "Utrata końcowej spacji dla fragmentu łączonego runtime"}], "action": "retranslate", "en": "You travel east across several large emerald bluffs and edges. All sorts of gems are scattered alongside your path. ", "translated": "Viaja hacia el este a través de varios grandes acantilados y bordes esmeralda. Todo tipo de gemas se encuentran esparcidas a lo largo de tu camino."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T12:20:44.264733Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.say_13", "source": "existing_value", "severity": "CRITICAL", "issues": [{"type": "trailing_space_contract", "severity": "CRITICAL", "message": "Utrata końcowej spacji dla fragmentu łączonego runtime"}], "action": "retranslate", "en": "You take a rather large ruby out of a pile before you. ", "translated": "Sacas un rubí bastante grande de una pila que tienes delante."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T12:20:44.268227Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.say_17", "source": "existing_value", "severity": "CRITICAL", "issues": [{"type": "trailing_space_contract", "severity": "CRITICAL", "message": "Utrata końcowej spacji dla fragmentu łączonego runtime"}, {"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >83 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "action": "retranslate", "en": "You travel all the way back down the dune and through the gate to the south. ", "translated": "Recorres todo el camino de regreso por la duna y atraviesas la puerta hacia el sur."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T12:20:44.269228Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.say_17", "source": "tm", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >83 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "You travel all the way back down the dune and through the gate to the south. ", "translated": "Recorres todo el camino de regreso por la duna y atraviesas la puerta hacia el sur. "}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T12:20:44.270044Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.say_18", "source": "existing_value", "severity": "CRITICAL", "issues": [{"type": "trailing_space_contract", "severity": "CRITICAL", "message": "Utrata końcowej spacji dla fragmentu łączonego runtime"}], "action": "retranslate", "en": "You return to the crimson sea of rubies in the south. ", "translated": "Regresas al mar carmesí de rubíes en el sur."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T12:20:44.271497Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.say_19", "source": "existing_value", "severity": "CRITICAL", "issues": [{"type": "trailing_space_contract", "severity": "CRITICAL", "message": "Utrata końcowej spacji dla fragmentu łączonego runtime"}], "action": "retranslate", "en": "You travel back to the plateau in the west. ", "translated": "Viajas de regreso a la meseta en el oeste."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T12:20:44.273595Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.say_20", "source": "existing_value", "severity": "CRITICAL", "issues": [{"type": "trailing_space_contract", "severity": "CRITICAL", "message": "Utrata końcowej spacji dla fragmentu łączonego runtime"}], "action": "retranslate", "en": "Advancing to the west, you recognise an increase of onyx on the ground. ", "translated": "Avanzando hacia el oeste, se reconoce un aumento de ónix en el suelo."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T12:20:44.276208Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.say_21", "source": "existing_value", "severity": "CRITICAL", "issues": [{"type": "trailing_space_contract", "severity": "CRITICAL", "message": "Utrata końcowej spacji dla fragmentu łączonego runtime"}], "action": "retranslate", "en": "You continue travelling the barren sea of gemstones to the north. ", "translated": "Continúas viajando por el árido mar de piedras preciosas hacia el norte."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T12:20:44.280760Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.say_22", "source": "existing_value", "severity": "CRITICAL", "issues": [{"type": "trailing_space_contract", "severity": "CRITICAL", "message": "Utrata końcowej spacji dla fragmentu łączonego runtime"}], "action": "retranslate", "en": "You leave the massive open gate behind you and go to the west. ", "translated": "Dejas la enorme puerta abierta detrás de ti y te diriges hacia el oeste."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T12:20:44.289095Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.say_5", "source": "existing_value", "severity": "CRITICAL", "issues": [{"type": "trailing_space_contract", "severity": "CRITICAL", "message": "Utrata końcowej spacji dla fragmentu łączonego runtime"}], "action": "retranslate", "en": "You wander to the south, passing large obelisks of emerald to your left and sprawling trees of topaz to your right. ", "translated": "Pasearás hacia el sur, pasando grandes obeliscos de esmeralda a tu izquierda y extensos árboles de topacio a tu derecha."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T12:20:44.290805Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.say_6", "source": "existing_value", "severity": "CRITICAL", "issues": [{"type": "trailing_space_contract", "severity": "CRITICAL", "message": "Utrata końcowej spacji dla fragmentu łączonego runtime"}], "action": "retranslate", "en": "As you rip the solid stand out of its socket and take it with you, the large gate opens with a deafening rumble. ", "translated": "Cuando arrancas el sólido soporte de su soporte y te lo llevas, la gran puerta se abre con un estruendo ensordecedor."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T12:20:44.293348Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.say_9", "source": "existing_value", "severity": "CRITICAL", "issues": [{"type": "trailing_space_contract", "severity": "CRITICAL", "message": "Utrata końcowej spacji dla fragmentu łączonego runtime"}], "action": "retranslate", "en": "You take an emerald from the pile. ", "translated": "Sacas una esmeralda del montón."}
