{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T13:30:05.562511Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.grizzly_adams.start_task_drakens", "source": "tm", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Go to the Zaoan landmass and reduce their number! Kill 900 drakens, I'll accept: draken abomination, draken elite, draken spellweaver and draken warmaster. Are you in?", "translated": "¡Ve a la masa continental de Zaoan y reduce su número! Mata a 900 drakens, lo aceptaré: abominación draken, élite draken, tejehechizos draken y maestro de guerra draken. ¿Estás dentro?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T13:30:05.573538Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.grizzly_adams.start_task_quara_scouts", "source": "tm", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >286 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "The {scouts} can be found on Malada, one of the Shattered Isles. Your task is to kill 400 quara scouts. I accept quara constrictor scouts, quara hydromancer scouts, quara mantassin scouts, quara pincher scouts and quara predator scouts, are you in?", "translated": "El {scouts} se puede encontrar en Malada, una de las Islas Destrozadas. Tu tarea es matar a 400 exploradores quara. Acepto exploradores quara constrictor, exploradores quara hidromante, exploradores quara mantassin, exploradores quara pincher y exploradores quara predator, ¿te apuntas?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T13:30:05.608343Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.guard_saros.say_42", "source": "tm", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >94 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "Yenny? I know no Yenny, nor have I ever used that name! You have mistook me with someone else.", "translated": "¿Yenny? ¡No conozco a Yenny, ni he usado ese nombre nunca! Me has confundido con otra persona."}
