{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T13:31:43.997431Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.guide.kunibert.L101.835", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Welcome to Rathleton, |PLAYERNAME|! Looking for a transport to the main isle of Oramond or would you like some information and a mapguide?", "translated": "¡Bienvenido a Rathleton, |PLAYERNAME|! ¿Busca un transporte a la isla principal de Oramond o desea información y una guía de mapas?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T13:31:43.999516Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.guide.luke.L103.466", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Hello there, |PLAYERNAME| and welcome to Thais! Would you like some {information} and a {map} guide?", "translated": "¡Hola, |PLAYERNAME| y bienvenido a Thais! ¿Quieres una guía de {information} y {map}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T13:31:44.001679Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.guide.rahlkora.L104.1325", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Welcome to Ankrahmun, |PLAYERNAME| This city can be a bit confusing at first. Would you like some information and a map guide?", "translated": "Bienvenido a Ankrahmun, |PLAYERNAME|. Esta ciudad puede resultar un poco confusa al principio. ¿Quieres información y una guía cartográfica?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T13:31:44.004107Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.guide.thelandil.L99.627", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Hello there, |PLAYERNAME| and welcome to Ab'Dendriel! Would you like some information and a map guide?", "translated": "¡Hola, |PLAYERNAME| y bienvenido a Ab'Dendriel! ¿Quieres información y una guía cartográfica?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T13:31:44.005382Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.guide.tiko.L103.800", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Hello there, and welcome to Port Hope! Would you like some information and a map guide?", "translated": "¡Hola y bienvenido a Port Hope! ¿Quieres información y una guía cartográfica?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T13:31:44.065205Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.iskan.L57.1280", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I was told you have been killing huskies here in Svargrond! Never do that again, okay? They are precious animals for us. Give me 500 gold and I will forget that incident without telling it to Jarl Sven. Okay?", "translated": "¡Me dijeron que has estado matando perros esquimales aquí en Svargrond! Nunca vuelvas a hacer eso, ¿vale? Son animales preciosos para nosotros. Dame 500 de oro y olvidaré ese incidente sin contárselo a Jarl Sven. ¿Bueno?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T13:31:44.066653Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.iskan.L59.1281", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "HAIL to the Warlord of the arena! |PLAYERNAME|, Hero of Svargrond! What can I {do for you}?", "translated": "¡Salve al señor de la guerra de la arena! |PLAYERNAME|, héroe de Svargrond! ¿Qué puedo {do for you}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T13:31:44.073000Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.iwar.L84.274", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Hiho Storm Killer! Welcome to Kazordoon furniture store.", "translated": "¡Hola, asesino de tormentas! Bienvenido a la tienda de muebles Kazordoon."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T13:31:44.076974Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.iyad.L108.747", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "D...Daraman's blessings... oh, how I m...miss my warm Darashia...", "translated": "D... las bendiciones de Daraman... oh, cómo extraño mi cálido Darashia..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T13:31:44.079600Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.jack.L67.1251", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You!! What have you told my family? They are mad at me and I don't even know why! They think I lied to them about working in Edron in secrecy! Why should I even do that!", "translated": "¡¡Tú!! ¿Qué le has dicho a mi familia? ¡Están enojados conmigo y ni siquiera sé por qué! ¡Creen que les mentí acerca de trabajar en Edron en secreto! ¿Por qué debería hacer eso?"}
