{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T14:02:14.967574Z", "lang": "de", "category": "scripts.json", "key": "scripts.2_ambassadors_treason.msg_3", "source": "existing_value", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >148 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}, {"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: schlecht", "examples": ["schlecht"]}], "action": "retranslate", "en": "Paper scraps lie scattered on the floor. It takes some time to put them back together. But it's only a badly written poem.", "translated": "Papierfetzen liegen verstreut auf dem Boden. Es dauert einige Zeit, sie wieder zusammenzusetzen. Aber es ist nur ein schlecht geschriebenes Gedicht."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T14:02:14.968359Z", "lang": "de", "category": "scripts.json", "key": "scripts.2_ambassadors_treason.msg_3", "source": "tm", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >148 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}, {"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: schlecht", "examples": ["schlecht"]}], "en": "Paper scraps lie scattered on the floor. It takes some time to put them back together. But it's only a badly written poem.", "translated": "Papierfetzen liegen verstreut auf dem Boden. Es dauert einige Zeit, sie wieder zusammenzusetzen. Aber es ist nur ein schlecht geschriebenes Gedicht."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T14:02:14.969423Z", "lang": "de", "category": "scripts.json", "key": "scripts.2_ambassadors_treason.msg_5", "source": "existing_value", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: sind", "examples": ["sind"]}], "action": "retranslate", "en": "You examine the scrolls carefully. Those are orders from Rathleton for the Ambassador. No sign of treason here.", "translated": "Sie untersuchen die Schriftrollen sorgfältig. Das sind Befehle von Rathleton für den Botschafter. Hier gibt es keine Anzeichen von Verrat."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T14:02:14.970310Z", "lang": "de", "category": "scripts.json", "key": "scripts.2_ambassadors_treason.msg_5", "source": "tm", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: sind", "examples": ["sind"]}], "en": "You examine the scrolls carefully. Those are orders from Rathleton for the Ambassador. No sign of treason here.", "translated": "Sie untersuchen die Schriftrollen sorgfältig. Das sind Befehle von Rathleton für den Botschafter. Hier gibt es keine Anzeichen von Verrat."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T14:02:14.971491Z", "lang": "de", "category": "scripts.json", "key": "scripts.2_ambassadors_treason.msg_7", "source": "existing_value", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: ihn", "examples": ["ihn"]}], "action": "retranslate", "en": "You find nothing in the Ambassador's house. If he's in fact a traitor he got rid of any evidence that could incriminate him.", "translated": "Im Haus des Botschafters findet man nichts. Wenn er tatsächlich ein Verräter ist, hat er alle Beweise beseitigt, die ihn belasten könnten."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T14:02:14.972311Z", "lang": "de", "category": "scripts.json", "key": "scripts.2_ambassadors_treason.msg_7", "source": "tm", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: ihn", "examples": ["ihn"]}], "en": "You find nothing in the Ambassador's house. If he's in fact a traitor he got rid of any evidence that could incriminate him.", "translated": "Im Haus des Botschafters findet man nichts. Wenn er tatsächlich ein Verräter ist, hat er alle Beweise beseitigt, die ihn belasten könnten."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T14:02:14.973439Z", "lang": "de", "category": "scripts.json", "key": "scripts.6_mind_travel.msg_2", "source": "existing_value", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: rechte", "examples": ["rechte"]}], "action": "retranslate", "en": "You were moved to the right brain side", "translated": "Du wurdest auf die rechte Gehirnseite verschoben"}
