{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T14:02:14.983905Z", "lang": "de", "category": "scripts.json", "key": "scripts.actions_bonefiddle.msg_3", "source": "existing_value", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: schöne", "examples": ["schöne"]}], "action": "retranslate", "en": "*There was once a maiden fair, with dark eyes and silken hair. Far away from home she died. No grave, no wake, no mourning.*", "translated": "*Es war einmal eine schöne Jungfrau mit dunklen Augen und seidenem Haar. Weit weg von zu Hause starb sie. Kein Grab, keine Totenwache, keine Trauer.*"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T14:02:14.984755Z", "lang": "de", "category": "scripts.json", "key": "scripts.actions_bonefiddle.msg_3", "source": "tm", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: schöne", "examples": ["schöne"]}], "en": "*There was once a maiden fair, with dark eyes and silken hair. Far away from home she died. No grave, no wake, no mourning.*", "translated": "*Es war einmal eine schöne Jungfrau mit dunklen Augen und seidenem Haar. Weit weg von zu Hause starb sie. Kein Grab, keine Totenwache, keine Trauer.*"}
