{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T15:08:05.086980Z", "lang": "pl", "category": "scripts.json", "key": "scripts.2_ambassadors_treason.msg_5", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You examine the scrolls carefully. Those are orders from Rathleton for the Ambassador. No sign of treason here.", "translated": "Dokładnie oglądasz zwoje. To rozkazy z Rathleton dla Ambasadora. Nie ma tu śladu zdrady."}
