{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T15:26:43.960347Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.pythius_the_rotten.stdmod_12", "source": "existing_value", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "artifact_tokens", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto artefakty typu TODO/[LANG]/????"}], "action": "retranslate", "en": "EVERYTHING YOU CARRY WITH YOU CAN ALSO BE FOUND IN MY {TREASURE}. BRING ME SOMETHING I DON'T OWN!!!", "translated": "TODO LO QUE LLEVAS CONTIGO TAMBIÉN LO PUEDES ENCONTRAR EN MI {TREASURE}. ¡¡¡TRAEME ALGO QUE NO TENGO!!!"}
