{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T15:39:15.827680Z", "lang": "pl", "category": "raids.json", "key": "raids.chayenne.chayenne.msg_3", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Chayenne has returned to his citadel once more. Be careful there.", "translated": "Chayenne powrócił do swojej cytadeli jeszcze raz. Bądź tam ostrożny."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T15:39:20.518316Z", "lang": "pl", "category": "raids.json", "key": "raids.darashia.lions.msg_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "There are more lions than usual west of Darashia.", "translated": "Na zachód od Darashia jest więcej lwów niż zwykle."}
