{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T15:44:27.081870Z", "lang": "pl", "category": "books.json", "key": "book.otbm.brog_however_laughed_over_the", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Brog however laughed over the dragon, which he had created, because he roamed over Tibia and was a terror to the few", "translated": "Brog jednak śmiał się ze smoka, którego stworzył, ponieważ wędrował po Tibia i był postrachem dla nielicznych"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T15:44:32.634205Z", "lang": "pl", "category": "books.json", "key": "book.otbm.buildings_disappeared_gradually_from_the", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "buildings disappeared gradually from the face of Tibia.", "translated": "budynki stopniowo znikały z oblicza Tibia."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T15:44:52.894237Z", "lang": "pl", "category": "books.json", "key": "book.otbm.but_when_the_orks_threatened", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "But when the Orks threatened to cover Tibia almost completely, the dragon came! They had decided that only they", "translated": "Ale kiedy Orkowie zagrozili, że niemal całkowicie zasłonią Tibia, pojawił się smok! Zdecydowali, że tylko oni"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T15:45:06.012289Z", "lang": "pl", "category": "books.json", "key": "book.otbm.centuries_ago_our_ancients_build", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Centuries ago, our ancients build this maze to protect our city Demona from bandits and warriors.", "translated": "Wieki temu nasi starożytni zbudowali ten labirynt, aby chronić nasze miasto Demona przed bandytami i wojownikami."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T15:45:17.720795Z", "lang": "pl", "category": "books.json", "key": "book.otbm.circle_of_the_creators_and", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "circle of the creators and help them with the task of the creation. Tibiasula agreed, because she also was fascinated by the idea", "translated": "kręgu twórców i pomóż im w zadaniu stworzenia. Tibiasula zgodziła się, ponieważ ona również była zafascynowana tym pomysłem"}
