{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T16:03:28.309022Z", "lang": "pl", "category": "quests.json", "key": "quests.kilmaresh.memory_word_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The Ambassador tells another dignitary: Rathleton must never be surpassed! I will procure that the Empire falters!", "translated": "Ambasador mówi innemu dygnitarzowi: Rathleton nigdy nie może zostać przekroczony! Sprawię, że Imperium upadnie!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T16:03:28.309830Z", "lang": "pl", "category": "quests.json", "key": "quests.kilmaresh.memory_word_2", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Through a dimensional gate you can see the Ambassador of Rathleton wearing a cloak with a black sphinx on it.", "translated": "Przez bramę wymiarową możesz zobaczyć Ambasadora Rathleton ubranego w płaszcz z czarnym sfinksem."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T16:03:28.310746Z", "lang": "pl", "category": "quests.json", "key": "quests.kilmaresh.memory_word_3", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Through a dimensional gate you can see how the Ambassador of Rathleton is talking to Fafnar cultists in a quite familiar way. The proof is absolutely substantive. The Ambassador is a betrayer!", "translated": "Przez bramę wymiarową możesz zobaczyć, jak Ambasador Rathleton rozmawia z kultystami Fafnar w całkiem znajomy sposób. Dowód jest całkowicie merytoryczny. Ambasador jest zdrajcą!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T16:04:06.568530Z", "lang": "pl", "category": "quests.json", "key": "quests.pits_of_inferno.throne_say_4", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You have touched Apocalypse's throne and absorbed some of his spirit.", "translated": "Dotknąłeś tronu Apocalypse i wchłonąłeś część jego ducha."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T16:04:38.145586Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_weakened_forest_fury.say_4", "source": "tm", "severity": "CRITICAL", "issues": [{"type": "identical_to_en", "severity": "CRITICAL", "message": "Tłumaczenie identyczne z EN"}], "action": "fallback_to_google_translate", "en": "Take care, guardian.", "translated": "Take care, guardian."}
