{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T16:06:40.788454Z", "lang": "pl", "category": "raids.json", "key": "raids.darashia.pirates.msg_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Pillage and plunder! Pirates have been sighted north of Darashia!.", "translated": "Grabieże i grabieże! Pirates zaobserwowano na północ od Darashia!."}
