{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T16:27:51.580602Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.captain.pelagia.L104.864", "source": "tm", "severity": "CRITICAL", "issues": [{"type": "identical_to_en", "severity": "CRITICAL", "message": "Tłumaczenie identyczne z EN"}], "action": "fallback_to_google_translate", "en": "Good bye then.", "translated": "Good bye then."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T16:27:51.985746Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.pukosch.L87.1589", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Welcome, |PLAYERNAME|! Do you feel adventurous? Do you want a weekly {ticket} for the ore wagon system here? You can use it right here to get to the centre of Kazordoon!", "translated": "¡Bienvenido, |PLAYERNAME|! ¿Te sientes aventurero? ¿Quiere un {ticket} semanal para el sistema de vagones de mineral aquí? ¡Puedes usarlo aquí mismo para llegar al centro de Kazordoon!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T16:27:52.014314Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.rata.mari.L103.828", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >84 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "Meep? I mean - hello! Sorry, |PLAYERNAME|... Being a {rat} has kind of grown on me.", "translated": "¿Mip? Quiero decir, ¡hola! Lo siento, |PLAYERNAME|... Ser {rat} me ha gustado mucho."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T16:27:52.047231Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.rottin.wood.L210.1031", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Hunter's greeting! I assume you want something from me since you came all the way out here on your own. This is a dangerous place to be, I doubt that all my men will accept strangers like I do. You don't seem to have any problems with that, though.", "translated": "¡El saludo de Hunter! Supongo que quieres algo de mí ya que viniste hasta aquí por tu cuenta. Este es un lugar peligroso, dudo que todos mis hombres acepten extraños como yo. Aunque no pareces tener ningún problema con eso."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T16:27:52.056724Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.sam.L153.910", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >83 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "Welcome to my shop, adventurer |PLAYERNAME|! I {trade} with weapons and armor.", "translated": "¡Bienvenido a mi tienda, aventurero |PLAYERNAME|! Yo {trade} con armas y armaduras."}
