{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T16:35:07.889983Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_11.mission_64.name", "source": "tm", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Paw and Fur: Tromphonyte", "translated": "Paw and Fur: Tromphonyte"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T16:35:14.354219Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_10.mission_10.state_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Palimuth told you that a circle of Yalahari is planning some kind of ritual. They plan to create a portal for some powerful demons and to unleash them in the city to 'purge' it once and for all.", "translated": "Palimuth te dijo que un círculo de Yalahari está planeando algún tipo de ritual. Planean crear un portal para algunos demonios poderosos y liberarlos en la ciudad para 'purge' de una vez por todas."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T16:35:17.542996Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_10.mission_10.state_3", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Report back to whichever principal you have chosen to help and you will receive Yalaharian Outfits.", "translated": "Informe al director que haya elegido para ayudar y recibirá trajes Yalaharian."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T16:35:17.544733Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_10.mission_2.state_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >154 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "You have to find all 7 guards and give a report to them. You should start by Foreign Quarter or by Trade Quarter and follow the order of the path..", "translated": "Tienes que encontrar a los 7 guardias y darles un informe. Debes comenzar por el Barrio Extranjero o por el Barrio Comercial y seguir el orden del camino."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T16:35:21.714731Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_10.mission_3.state_3", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Get the notes behind the Yalahari and read them. Talk to Azerus again and ask him for mission when you've read the notes.", "translated": "Obtenga las notas detrás del Yalahari y léalas. Habla con Azerus nuevamente y pídele una misión cuando hayas leído las notas."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T16:35:21.715926Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_10.mission_3.state_5", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "First you will need to kill the three plague bearers and then get The Alchemists' Formulas. When this have been done head back to either Palimuth (good side) or Yalahari (Azerus) (bad side).", "translated": "Primero tendrás que matar a los tres portadores de la plaga y luego conseguir las fórmulas de los alquimistas. Cuando hayas hecho esto, regresa a Palimuth (lado bueno) o Yalahari (Azerus) (lado malo)."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T16:35:27.869016Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_10.mission_5.state_5", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Report back to Tamerin as he will listen to your request and you can now make your choice: Cattle for Palimuth (good side), Warbeasts for Yalahari (Azerus) (bad side). Then report the one you decided your mission.", "translated": "Informe a Tamerin, él escuchará su solicitud y ahora podrá elegir: Ganado para Palimuth (lado bueno), Bestias de guerra para Yalahari (Azerus) (lado malo). Luego informa el que decidiste tu misión."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T16:35:27.872306Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_10.mission_6.state_2", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Yalahari (Azerus) orders you to travel to the Cemetery Quarter and find the Strange Carving. He gives you a Ghost Charm and tells you to charge it with the tormented souls of the ghosts there to be used as an energy source. Palimuth wants the Charged Ghost Charm in order to free those souls. You can new use the Cemetery Quarter mechanism now. Go to the big building in the Cemetery Quarter and use the Ghost Charm on the Strange Carving at the back of the room.", "translated": "Yalahari (Azerus) te ordena que viajes al Barrio del Cementerio y encuentres la Talla Extraña. Él te da un encantamiento fantasma y te dice que lo cargues con las almas atormentadas de los fantasmas que hay allí para usarlos como fuente de energía. Palimuth quiere el encantamiento fantasma cargado para liberar esas almas. Ahora puedes volver a utilizar el mecanismo del Barrio del Cementerio. Ve al edificio grande en el Barrio del Cementerio y usa el encantamiento fantasma en la talla extraña en la parte trasera de la habitación."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T16:35:27.873718Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_10.mission_6.state_3", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Good side: Go to Palimuth, ask him about your mission, and hand in the charm. Bad side: Ask about your mission to Yalahari (Azerus) and give it back.", "translated": "Lado bueno: ve a Palimuth, pregúntale sobre tu misión y entrega el amuleto. Lado malo: pregunta sobre tu misión a Yalahari (Azerus) y devuélvela."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T16:35:31.279564Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_10.mission_7.state_2", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Bad side: Yalahari (Azerus) will send you for a new mission to go to the Sunken Quarter and kill the Quara Leaders, Inky, Splasher and Sharptooth. Good side: Rather than fighting any Quara leaders Palimuth will instead send you to find the cause for the Quaras aggressive behavior. Find Maritima and talk to her about the Quara and she will explain what their problem is.", "translated": "Lado malo: Yalahari (Azerus) te enviará a una nueva misión para ir al Barrio Hundido y matar a los Líderes Quara, Inky, Splasher y Sharptooth. Lado bueno: en lugar de luchar contra los líderes de Quara, Palimuth te enviará a encontrar la causa del comportamiento agresivo de Quaras. Encuentra a Maritima y habla con ella sobre los Quara y ella te explicará cuál es su problema."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T16:35:31.281206Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_10.mission_8.state_2", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Bad side: For this mission the Yalahari requests you go to the Factory Quarter and find a pattern crystal, which will be used to supply weapons to help take control of the city. Good side: Palimuth will send you there to use the crystal to supply food for the city.", "translated": "Lado malo: Para esta misión, Yalahari te pide que vayas al Factory Quarter y encuentres un patrón de cristal, que se usará para suministrar armas y ayudar a tomar el control de la ciudad. Lado bueno: Palimuth te enviará allí para usar el cristal para suministrar alimentos a la ciudad."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T16:35:31.282172Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_10.mission_9.state_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You now need to decide between supporting Palimuth or the Yalahari's goal. To choose Palimuth's good side go to him, and simply ask him for a mission mission. Likewise, to join the Yalahari (Azerus) (bad side) go to him and say the same.", "translated": "Ahora debes decidir entre apoyar a Palimuth o el objetivo de Yalahari. Para elegir el lado bueno de Palimuth, ve con él y simplemente pídele una misión. Asimismo, para unirte al Yalahari (Azerus) (lado malo) ve con él y dile lo mismo."}
