{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T16:53:30.575337Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L251.967", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Good bye traveller, and enjoy your stay on Rookgaard.", "translated": "Adiós viajero y disfrute de su estadía en Rookgaard."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T16:53:30.576947Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L70.954", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Hello |PLAYERNAME|, nice to see you on Rookgaard! I saw you walking by and wondered if you could help me. Could you? Please, say {yes}!", "translated": "Hola |PLAYERNAME|, ¡encantado de verte en Rookgaard! Te vi pasar y me pregunté si podrías ayudarme. ¿Podrías? ¡Por favor, diga {yes}!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T16:53:30.586840Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.sarina.L89.76", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >92 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "Of course, just browse through my wares. {Footballs} have to be purchased separately.", "translated": "Por supuesto, simplemente navega por mis productos. {Footballs} debe comprarse por separado."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T16:53:30.588541Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.scrutinon.L101.1548", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "|PLAYERNAME|. I have been watching your fate for quite some time. It's about time you came here. Do you seek to enter the riven island of Quirefang or travel back from where you came?", "translated": "|PLAYERNAME|. He estado observando tu destino durante bastante tiempo. Ya era hora de que vinieras aquí. ¿Buscas entrar a la isla dividida de Quirefang o viajar de regreso desde donde viniste?"}
