{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T17:42:05.531859Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.omrabas.multi_35", "source": "existing_value", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "artifact_tokens", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto artefakty typu TODO/[LANG]/????"}, {"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >82 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "action": "retranslate", "en": "In the Dragonbone Cemetery, OBVIOUSLY! Must I explain EVERYTHING to you? Now go!", "translated": "En el Cementerio Dragonbone, ¡OBVIAMENTE! ¿Tengo que explicarte TODO? ¡Ahora vete!"}
