{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T18:31:53.963240Z", "lang": "pl", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.paulie.say_1", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >133 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla pl"}], "en": "Every Adventurer has one. The big advantage is that you can access your money in every branch of the World Bank! ...", "translated": "Kazdy poszukiwacz przygod ma takie konto. Wielka zaleta jest to, ze masz dostep do swoich pieniedzy w kazdym oddziale World Bank! ..."}
