{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T18:34:29.655652Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.scripts.quests.cults.of.tibia.movements.check.oasis.L10.2108", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >86 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "You have found a lovely oasis with green fauna and juicy fruit. You didn't expect that.", "translated": "Has encontrado un encantador oasis con fauna verde y fruta jugosa. No te lo esperabas."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T18:34:29.662712Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.scripts.quests.cults.of.tibia.movements.energy.fence.L49.2121", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >127 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "As you cross the threshold in to the inner sanctuary of the cult of the Misguided, you feel an eerie presence all around you.", "translated": "Al cruzar el umbral hacia el santuario interior del culto de los Extraviados, sientes una presencia inquietante a tu alrededor."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T18:34:29.666757Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.scripts.quests.cults.of.tibia.movements.ice.death.L63.2088", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You are still blessed with Wisdom of Solitude, Spark of the Phoenix, Fire of the Suns, Spiritual Shielding, Embrace of Tibia, Heart of the Mountain, Blood of the Mountain, and Twist of Fate.", "translated": "Aún estás bendecido con Sabiduría de la Soledad, Chispa del Fénix, Fuego de los Soles, Blindaje Espiritual, Abrazo de Tibia, Corazón de la Montaña, Sangre de la Montaña, y Giro del Destino."}
