{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T18:46:38.712647Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.navigator.multi_2", "source": "existing_value", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "artifact_tokens", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto artefakty typu TODO/[LANG]/????"}], "action": "retranslate", "en": "The stones on the beach? The trader up there? That was ME ALL THE TIME! I lured YOU into creating all this chaos up there and down here! ...", "translated": "¿Las piedras en la playa? ¿El comerciante de ahí arriba? ¡Ese era YO TODO EL TIEMPO! ¡Te atraje a TI para que crearas todo este caos allá arriba y aquí abajo! ..."}
