{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T19:04:52.306325Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.raymond_striker.multi_21", "source": "existing_value", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "artifact_tokens", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto artefakty typu TODO/[LANG]/????"}], "action": "retranslate", "en": "In the tavern, the pirates feel safe and plan their next strikes. Study ALL of their maps and plans lying around ...", "translated": "En la taberna, los piratas se sienten seguros y planean sus próximos ataques. Estudia TODOS sus mapas y planos que hay por ahí..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T19:04:52.307170Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.raymond_striker.multi_21", "source": "tm", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "artifact_tokens", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto artefakty typu TODO/[LANG]/????"}], "en": "In the tavern, the pirates feel safe and plan their next strikes. Study ALL of their maps and plans lying around ...", "translated": "En la taberna, los piratas se sienten seguros y planean sus próximos ataques. Estudia TODOS sus mapas y planos que hay por ahí..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T19:04:52.522818Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.sane_mage.multi_5", "source": "existing_value", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "artifact_tokens", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto artefakty typu TODO/[LANG]/????"}], "action": "retranslate", "en": "At least I have my trusty {servants} helping me to clean up. They do ALL the work. Removing ALL the slime. At least they're working as intended. I designed them, you know.", "translated": "Al menos tengo a mi confiable {servants} ayudándome a limpiar. Ellos hacen TODO el trabajo. Quitando TODA la baba. Al menos están funcionando según lo previsto. Yo los diseñé, ¿sabes?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T19:04:52.523784Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.sane_mage.multi_5", "source": "tm", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "artifact_tokens", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto artefakty typu TODO/[LANG]/????"}], "en": "At least I have my trusty {servants} helping me to clean up. They do ALL the work. Removing ALL the slime. At least they're working as intended. I designed them, you know.", "translated": "Al menos tengo a mi confiable {servants} ayudándome a limpiar. Ellos hacen TODO el trabajo. Quitando TODA la baba. Al menos están funcionando según lo previsto. Yo los diseñé, ¿sabes?"}
