{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T19:07:04.242352Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.scripts.quests.demon.oak.movements.entrance.L33.1985", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Go talk with Odralk and get the Hallowed Axe to kill The Demon Oak.", "translated": "Ve a hablar con Odralk y consigue el Hacha Santificada para matar al Roble Demoníaco."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T19:07:04.288627Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.scripts.quests.ferumbras.ascension.actions.tarbaz.notes.L13.1936", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >84 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "Suddenly, you see the latter A. It all makes sense now. And then you now the secret.", "translated": "De repente, ves la letra A. Todo tiene sentido ahora. Y entonces conoces el secreto."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T19:07:04.289940Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.scripts.quests.ferumbras.ascension.actions.tarbaz.notes.L7.1935", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >81 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "Suddenly, you see the big picture. It all makes sense now. And then you despair.", "translated": "De repente, ves la imagen completa. Todo tiene sentido ahora. Y luego desesperas."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T19:07:04.298962Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.scripts.quests.ferumbras.ascension.movements.zamulosh.teleport.L13.1967", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >81 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "What was wrong is not necessarily right now. Nevertheless you nade it further.", "translated": "Lo que estaba mal no es necesariamente correcto ahora. Sin embargo, has avanzado."}
