{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T19:27:24.298740Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.scripts.quests.in.service.of.yalahar.actions.yalahar.machine.war.golems.L49.2178", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >98 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "You insert all 4 gear wheels, them adjusting the teleporter to transport you to the deeper floor", "translated": "Insertas las 4 ruedas dentadas, ajustando el teletransportador para transportarte al piso inferior"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T19:27:24.308788Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.scripts.quests.kilmaresh.quest.1.fafnars.wrath.2.ambassadors.treason.L24.2272", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >112 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "Paper scraps lie scattered on the floor. It takes some time to put them back together. But it's only a badly written poem.", "translated": "Trozos de papel yacen esparcidos por el suelo. Toma algo de tiempo juntarlos. Pero es solo un poema mal escrito."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T19:27:24.314184Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.scripts.quests.kilmaresh.quest.1.fafnars.wrath.2.ambassadors.treason.L41.2274", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You examine the scrolls carefully. Those are orders from Rathleton for the Ambassador. No sign of treason here.", "translated": "Examinas los pergaminos cuidadosamente. Son órdenes de Rathleton para el Embajador. No hay señal de traición aquí."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T19:27:24.317479Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.scripts.quests.kilmaresh.quest.1.fafnars.wrath.2.ambassadors.treason.L58.2276", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >131 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "You find nothing in the Ambassador's house. If he's in fact a traitor he got rid of any evidence that could incriminate him.", "translated": "No encuentras nada en la casa del Embajador. Si de hecho es un traidor, se deshizo de cualquier evidencia que pudiera incriminarlo."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T19:27:24.333623Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.scripts.quests.kilmaresh.quest.actions.coruja.L5.1660", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You discover an owl resting in a tree. Thats special, because you have never seen an owl in all of Kilmaresh.", "translated": "Descubres un búho descansando en un árbol. Eso es especial, porque nunca habías visto un búho en todo Kilmaresh."}
