{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T19:58:58.630528Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.barnabas_dee.say_5", "source": "existing_value", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "word_repetition", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Powtórzony wyraz 3+ razy"}], "action": "retranslate", "en": "No no no, I need 15 doses of freshly harvested pollen! Please, harvest those 15 doses yourself, to make absolutely sure you have first-rate quality. I am afraid nothing less will do.", "translated": "No no no, necesito 15 dosis de polen recién cosechado! Por favor, coseche esas 15 dosis usted mismo para asegurarse de tener una calidad de primer nivel. Me temo que nada menos servirá."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T19:58:58.631575Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.barnabas_dee.say_5", "source": "tm", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "word_repetition", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Powtórzony wyraz 3+ razy"}], "en": "No no no, I need 15 doses of freshly harvested pollen! Please, harvest those 15 doses yourself, to make absolutely sure you have first-rate quality. I am afraid nothing less will do.", "translated": "No no no, necesito 15 dosis de polen recién cosechado! Por favor, coseche esas 15 dosis usted mismo para asegurarse de tener una calidad de primer nivel. Me temo que nada menos servirá."}
